@startuml state-card-session-egk
title CardSession_eGK Lifecycle

[*] --> OPEN : TUC_KON_026\n(session created, no lock)
OPEN --> LOCKED : StartCardSession / TUC_KON_223\n(sessionID assigned, timer started, card reset)
LOCKED --> OPEN : StopCardSession / TUC_KON_224\n(lock released, card reset)
LOCKED --> OPEN : CARD_SESSION_TIMEOUT\n(auto-stop; CARD/SESSION/TIMEOUT event)
OPEN --> [*] : card ejected
LOCKED --> [*] : card ejected\n(lock forcibly released)

note right of LOCKED
  Only one LOCKED session
  per eGK at any time (C1)
  Error 4093 on second attempt
end note
@enduml
